00:06:24.422 --> 00:06:28.582
That precision really gives a smoother&nbsp;
shave. This razor has very little&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:28.582 --> 00:06:32.982
blade exposure - less than 30 microns. And&nbsp;
it's easy to use - there's no learning&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:32.982 --> 00:06:37.702
period like with other safety razors because&nbsp;
the shaving angle is built into the head design.

00:06:37.702 --> 00:06:41.702
Now that I've tried out a Henson, I&nbsp;
won't be using disposable razors anymore.

00:06:41.702 --> 00:06:45.222
Although this razor costs more than&nbsp;
disposable ones, you make your money&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:45.222 --> 00:06:50.742
back because it lasts a lifetime. And get&nbsp;
this - the cost of a blade is only 10 cents.

00:06:50.742 --> 00:06:55.462
If you change your blade every week then&nbsp;
you’ll pay just $5 for an entire year’s supply.

00:06:55.462 --> 00:06:58.582
The razor comes in eight colors&nbsp;
and ships all around the world.

00:06:58.582 --> 00:07:01.622
If you’d like to try out a Henson&nbsp;
razor - or gift one to your family or a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:01.622 --> 00:07:04.502
friend - then you can use the link in my description.

00:07:04.502 --> 00:07:12.822
Thanks so much for watching. For Newsthink, I’m Cindy Pom.

